holistic_landmarker.task - Google MediaPipe Holistic Landmarker
Copyright The MediaPipe Authors (Google LLC)
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (LICENSE in this folder).

It holds Google's body and hand models (DireBot for OBS uses these four
of them, for its hands and arms; the face ones in it go unused):
  pose_detector.tflite             - finds a body (BlazePose)
  pose_landmarks_detector.tflite   - BlazePose GHUM: 33 points on a body
  hand_roi_refinement.tflite       - where a hand is, from the body's points
  hand_landmarks_detector.tflite   - 21 points on a hand
Model cards: https://ai.google.dev/edge/mediapipe/solutions/vision/holistic_landmarker

The file is Google's, unchanged, as downloaded from
https://storage.googleapis.com/mediapipe-models/holistic_landmarker/holistic_landmarker/float16/1/holistic_landmarker.task
